{"id": "288405", "name": "מציאת אופרטור נורמלי ע\"פ גרעין ותמונה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "randmat3", "params": ["k"], "body": "matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-k,k,[]),rand_with_prohib(-k,k,[])],[0,1,rand_with_prohib(-k,k,[])],[0,0,1]) . transpose(matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-k,k,[]),rand_with_prohib(-k,k,[])],[0,1,rand_with_prohib(-k,k,[])],[0,0,1]))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(V=\\mathbb{R}^3\\)</span> עם מכפלה פנימית סטנדרטית.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו אופרטור נורמלי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T:V \\to V\\)</span> כך ש-</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ker(T) = span \\left \\{ {{CT:0}},&nbsp;{{CT:1}} \\right \\} .\\]</p><p>והפולינום האופייני של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T\\)</span> הינו</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[f_T(x)=x^2({{CT:2}}).\\]</p><p>הזינו בסיס סדור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span> כלשהו לבחירתכם, ואז הזינו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([T]_B^B\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(B\\) = [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-veclist\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: וקטורי עמודה בתוך סוגריים מרובעים, מופרדים בפסיקים. למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">[matrix([1],[2],[0]), matrix([0],[1],[3])]</code>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\([T]_B^B\\) = [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 50, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "if matrixp(ans1) then an1:transpose(ans1) else an1:ans1;\n\ndd(j):=(lt1:listify(setify(map(abs,append(map(num, flatten(args(an1[j]))),map(denom, flatten(args(an1[j]))))))), l1:[1], for i:1 while i<=length(lt1) do (if sin(pi*lt1[i])#0 then l1:append(l1,[lt1[i]])),product(l1[i],i,1,length(l1)));\n\nan1:[dd(1)*an1[1],dd(2)*an1[2],dd(3)*an1[3]];\n\nstudBaseMat: if (length(an1) = 3) then addcol(transpose(matrix(flatten(args(an1[1])))),transpose(matrix(flatten(args(an1[2])))),transpose(matrix(flatten(args(an1[3]))))) else matrix([0,0,0],[0,0,0],[0,0,0]);\n\nif matrixp(ans2) then an2:ans2 else an2:addcol(ans2[1],ans2[2],ans2[3]);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "rank(studBaseMat)", "tans": "3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הוקטורים שהזנתם אינם מהווים בסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^3\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "invert(baseMat) . studBaseMat . an2 . invert(studBaseMat) . baseMat", "tans": "matT", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">יפה מאוד</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">המטריצה אינה מקיימת את הנדרש.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["baseMat", "invMat", "matT", "n"], "nvariants": 50}